      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: The ore is pre-treated,  reduced and refined according to the country specific mix of process alternatives: reverberatory furnace 22.8%; flash smelting furnaces 75.7%; other 1.5%.; SX-EW 0.0%. An overall abatement for sulphur dioxide of 20.0% was estimated.</text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
